# frontend/web/.env — the app (npm run dev) against the LIVE server (docs/workflow.md → "Mac पर app").
# 1) Copy this file to `.env` in frontend/web.
# 2) Paste the anon key (the public key the live website also uses). Never paste a service-role key here.
# 3) `.env` is git-ignored: do not commit it.
# Data is live: test only on the TEST client.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://api.qengineering.in
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=Paste the anon key here
VITE_PDF_SERVICE_URL=https://pdf.qengineering.in/pdf
